Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}源代码
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我采纳了你的意见 很不错 谢了\N{\r}I took your advice. It was good advice, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你脸色苍白 没事吧\N{\r}You're pale, everything ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}肖恩\N{\r}Shawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}肖恩\N{\r}Shawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}听着 我之所以要取消...\N{\r}Anyway listen I wanted to tell you, only reason why I canceled...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一天给我打三次电话 现在这来电的次数\N{\r}Oh, he's calling me three times a day. I hear more from him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}比我们分手前还多 这人有毛病吧\N{\r}than I did when we were together. What is it with guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我提出申请了\N{\r}I gave notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}您的车票\N{\r}Ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}什么申请\N{\r}Notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}请出示您的车票\N{\r}May I see your ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我...\N{\r}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}今天早上你都有点魂不守舍 没事吧\N{\r}You are acting a little strange this morning, are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}您的票\N{\r}Ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 晚点的十分钟能追回来吧 - 先生 我们尽量\N{\r}- Are we gonna make up the ten minute? - We gonna try, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}老头 他妈的怎么晚点了\N{\r}Hey, grandpa, what the hell was the delay back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我只负责查票 - 你真该插自己...\N{\r}- I just punch the tickets, Sir. - You should punch your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}肖恩 我做了什么吗\N{\r}Shawn, did I do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}听着 我知道\N{\r}Look, I can see that you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你觉得你认识我 但我不认识你\N{\r}think you know me but I don't know who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是考尔特·斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}My name is Captain Colter Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是驻阿富汗美军的直升机飞行员\N{\r}I fly helicopter for the US Army in Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 肖恩 这也太... - 肖恩\N{\r}- Shawn, that's... - Shawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我有点恶心\N{\r}I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我靠 - 对不起 我帮你捡\N{\r}- Dammit! - Sorry! Let me help with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没事 不要紧的\N{\r}No, it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}沃尔特·里德 部队医疗中心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}先生 等下\N{\r}Hey mister! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你把这落下了 - 谢谢\N{\r}- Hey, you dropped this! - Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这是哪 - 芝加哥\N{\r}- What is that? - Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}车门即将关闭 请全员上车\N{\r}All aboard. Doors are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}本车是芝加哥城郊往返列\N{\r}This is a Chicago- down train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你没事吧 上尉先生\N{\r}You ok there, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你看到了吗\N{\r}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你真把我吓到了\N{\r}You kinda freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不不不不不不不...\N{\r}Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}西恩·芬特雷斯 教师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你没事吧 - 我不知道到底怎么回事\N{\r}- Are you alright? - I don't know, what's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 肖恩 跟我说说 - 听着 我不知道谁是肖恩\N{\r}- Talk to me Shawn! - Look, I don't know who Shawn is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我也不认识你\N{\r}and I don't know who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这样 我们下站下车\N{\r}Ok, we get off at the next stop
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就当什么也没发生过 好吗\N{\r}and forget whatever is going on here, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这压根不是我的\N{\r}This doesn't belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}看着我 一切都会好起来的\N{\r}Look at me, everything is gonna be ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}考尔特·斯蒂文斯上尉 这是围城\N{\r}Captain Colter Stevens, this is Beleaguered Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}考尔特·斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}Captain Colter Stevens,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是围城 请确认通信\N{\r}this is Beleaguered Castle, acknowledge transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}斯蒂文斯上尉 收到了吗\N{\r}Captain Stevens, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我这是在哪\N{\r}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你正在"围城"中 你还好吗\N{\r}You are with "Beleaguered Castle." Are you functional?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}头晕 我是不是被锁住了\N{\r}I am dizzy. Did I... Did I just a- lock?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在调整你的朝向\N{\r}Adjusting your rotation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你这次能报告了吗\N{\r}Can you report this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这他妈是什么鬼东西\N{\r}Fuck is this? What this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你在...我这是跟谁在说话\N{\r}Where... who I am talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 描述下你刚才的所见所闻\N{\r}Captain report what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我听不懂你在说什么\N{\r}What, I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}和我说话前 你在哪\N{\r}Where were you before you were talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 那里发生了爆炸 - 哪里\N{\r}- There was an explosion. - Coming from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在这个阶段意识有点模糊很正常 上尉\N{\r}Some confusion is perfectly normal at this stage, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}能看到画面吗\N{\r}Do you have a visual signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是谁\N{\r}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你知道我是谁 - 知道吗\N{\r}- You already have that information, Captain. - I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}说出我的名字\N{\r}Recall my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们将重建片段 请集中注意力\N{\r}We'll rebuild the pattern. Try to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我...在执行任务\N{\r}I... was on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在开飞机\N{\r}I was flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}醒来之后就在一辆火车上\N{\r}And then I woke up on a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在又到这了\N{\r}Now I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你得跟我说清楚\N{\r}I need to be briefed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说这是什么部队来着\N{\r}Uhm, wha- what unit is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 围城 - 谁\N{\r}- You're with Beleaguered Castle. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}准备启动阿尔法记忆片段一号线程\N{\r}Stand by for thread 1 of alpha memory pattern.
