Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 那就回去再试一次 - 回哪去\N{\r}- Then go back and try again. - Back where?
