Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 我受够这狗血的模拟测试了 \N{\r}No, no, no, no, no. No more bullshit sim tests, ok?
