Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我该...拆了它 还是该忽略它\N{\r}Should I... unplug it? Or do you want me to just leave it?
