Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.19,0:33:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它存有一个短期记忆轨迹 \N{\r}It contains a short- term memory track
