Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.68,0:33:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}每一天的最后部分\N{\r}on its hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.20,0:33:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}把这两种现象结合起来\N{\r}Now combining these two phenomena, circuitry that
