Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.37,0:34:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}记忆库前调8分钟\N{\r}that goes back 8 minutes
