Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}都十分匹配\N{\r}body size and your synaptic maps.
