Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.90,0:46:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}马上接通拉特里奇博士\N{\r}Dr Rutledge will be on in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.89,0:46:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我有事要跟你说 - 我知道 我找到他了\N{\r}- I have to tell you something. - I know, I found him.
