Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.11,0:46:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 肖恩 他死了 - 什么\N{\r}- He's dead, Shawn. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}抱歉 你朋友两个月前执行任务时殉职了\N{\r}I am sorry. Your friend was killed in action two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.36,0:46:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 你肯定把名字搞错了\N{\r}No, you must have gotten the name wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.22,0:46:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}考尔特·斯蒂文斯\N{\r}Colter Stevens,
