Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.21,0:46:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他父亲叫唐纳德 对吧\N{\r}His father's name is Donald, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是上周新闻\N{\r}This is from last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.68,0:46:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}唐纳德·斯蒂文斯\N{\r}Donald Stevens
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.65,0:46:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}将与艾伦诺·戈瓦一起\N{\r}will join host Eleonor Gwah
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.21,0:46:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}主持商议他儿子的死\N{\r}to discuss the death of his son, Army Captain Colter Stevens
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.77,0:46:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}陆军上尉考尔特·斯蒂文斯\N{\r}who died in Afghanistan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.32,0:46:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}二月死于阿富汗\N{\r}in February
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.49,0:46:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}死后被授予了银星\N{\r}and was honored posthumously with the silver star.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.45,0:46:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}新闻中还提到\N{\r}Also on the broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.83,0:46:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}will be Army Sergent Rorbert Alvarez,
