Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.09,0:47:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}节哀顺变\N{\r}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.58,0:47:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉\N{\r}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.26,0:47:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 肖恩 说句话 - 上尉\N{\r}- Shawn... talk to me. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}Captain Stevens,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.81,0:47:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是柯琳·戈德温上尉\N{\r}my name is Captain Colleen Goodwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.58,0:47:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这里是围城 你没事了\N{\r}You're with operation Beleaguered Castle. You are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.07,0:47:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}告诉我你看见了什么\N{\r}Now, can you tell me what you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.98,0:47:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 回想一下 - 我看见了一张牌\N{\r}- Just look and think. - I see a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.49,0:47:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很好\N{\r}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.79,0:47:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}能听见吗 我们受到了猛烈的火箭弹攻击\N{\r}Do you copy, we're taking a lot of RPG fire here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.03,0:47:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我死了吗\N{\r}Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.10,0:48:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一个广播节目说一架直升机在乡村坠毁\N{\r}A radio listing is saying that
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.49,0:48:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我死在里面了\N{\r}I died in a helicopter crash in country,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.53,0:48:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我父亲替我接受了勋章\N{\r}and my father received a medal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.03,0:48:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的情况与此任务无关\N{\r}Your condition is not the issue here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.52,0:48:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你应该尽力阻止接下来的爆炸\N{\r}You need to focus on preventing any subsequent attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.04,0:48:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}其他的都无关紧要\N{\r}Everything else is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.15,0:48:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}新闻说我死了 这无关紧要吗\N{\r}News report saying that I am dead is irrelevant?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.95,0:48:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在火车设弹人\N{\r}Until the person or persons
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.80,0:48:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}被抓到之前 是的\N{\r}who blew up that train are in custody... yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.23,0:48:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温\N{\r}Goodwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.68,0:48:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}将心比心 我是死了吗\N{\r}One soldier to another. Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.20,0:48:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你大脑的一部分仍在运作\N{\r}Part of your brain remains activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.36,0:48:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那我身体的其它部分呢\N{\r}What about the rest of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.57,0:48:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的手脚仍然可以动\N{\r}I can see my hands and my feet. They still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.00,0:48:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它们只是表象\N{\r}They're a manifestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.76,0:48:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是你的主观想象\N{\r}They're just your way of making sense of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.11,0:48:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是说 这一切都是我的想象吗\N{\r}So..What are you saying? Are you saying that I am imagining this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.43,0:49:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我想象...自己仍然\N{\r}I'm imagining that ...I am still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.63,0:49:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}活在这机舱里吗\N{\r}that I am in this capsule?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第四安培数下降\N{\r}We have fourth amp dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.98,0:49:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 里面怎么了\N{\r}Captain, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.73,0:49:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}能问你个问题吗\N{\r}Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.04,0:49:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个机舱也只是个表象\N{\r}The capsule is a manifestation as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.48,0:49:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我在哪儿 - 这是机密\N{\r}- Where am I? - That's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.65,0:49:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}操你妈的\N{\r}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.63,0:50:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 我不能体会你现在的心情\N{\r}Captain, I can not imagine what you must be feeling right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.17,0:50:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但我们必须马上\N{\r}but if are to prevent a second attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.76,0:50:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}送你回去阻止第二场爆炸\N{\r}we need to send you back immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.77,0:50:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 你在源代码中时\N{\r}And Captain, you cannot deviate from the mission
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.48,0:50:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不能分心想任务以外的事情 甚至...\N{\r}while inside the Source Code. Even to investigate your...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.49,0:50:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不能去深究自己发生了什么事\N{\r}Even to investigate what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.62,0:50:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个终端的程序一致连续 由不得你乱搅和\N{\r}There is only one continuum on this end and it can't be unsettled.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.46,0:50:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我刚还真就搅和了 我从车上给你打电话了\N{\r}Well, you know, I did unsettle it. I called you from the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.31,0:50:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就在爆炸之前\N{\r}Just before the explosion,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.80,0:50:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}今早7点46分 他们呼叫了你...\N{\r}so 7:46 this morning they paged you with a call...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.59,0:50:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你可能在火车上给我打了电话\N{\r}You may have made that call from the train,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.77,0:50:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但我在这收不到\N{\r}but I would never receive it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.69,0:50:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是不同的世界 上尉\N{\r}It's a different reality, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.74,0:50:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就算电话接通了\N{\r}If the call even went through it would be
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.83,0:50:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}接电话的也是一个完全不同的我\N{\r}received by a different me entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.50,0:50:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这你听起来可能很费解\N{\r}This may be difficult for you to hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.18,0:50:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但你就是时钟上的指针\N{\r}but you are a hand on a clock, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.60,0:50:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们给你上了发条 你就开始转动\N{\r}We set you, you move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.48,0:50:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}再上一次发条 你又开始转动\N{\r}We reset you, you move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.07,0:50:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的作用就体现在此\N{\r}And that represents the entirety of your function here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.26,0:51:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}下次我要给你寄个披萨\N{\r}You know what, next time, I'll send you a pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.33,0:51:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我倒要看看 这有没有用\N{\r}I see, if that makes an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.04,0:51:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你无法在源代码中\N{\r}You cannot alter the continuum
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.74,0:51:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}改变现实的连续性\N{\r}of this reality from within the Source Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.18,0:51:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你弄的这玩意肯定是违法的\N{\r}This can't be legal what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.80,0:51:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}实际上 \N{\r}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.73,0:51:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你大脑的使用权和整个项目\N{\r}your acquisition by this program as well as the program itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.32,0:51:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}都通过了军事法庭的审核\N{\r}has been reviewed and sanctioned by a military court.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.76,0:51:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}许多士兵都会认为\N{\r}You know, many soldiers would
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.21,0:51:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}执行这任务比死了要好\N{\r}find this preferable to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.58,0:51:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为有机会继续为国家效力\N{\r}The opportunity to continue serving their country.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.51,0:51:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}长官\N{\r}Have you....
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.91,0:51:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你到底经历过真刀真枪的战斗吗\N{\r}Have you spent much time in battle, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.12,0:51:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这无关紧要\N{\r}That's immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.94,0:51:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的战友们都会认为\N{\r}Any soldier I've ever served with
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.40,0:51:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为国效力 死一次就够了\N{\r}could say that one death is service enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.54,0:51:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好吧 只要你完成了任务 我就答应你的要求\N{\r}Fine, you can have that in return for completing this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.24,0:51:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 什么要求 - 给你你想要的\N{\r}- Wha... Have what? - I'll give you what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.20,0:51:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}终结你的服役 让你安息\N{\r}Terminate your service, let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.14,0:51:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}浪费太多时间了\N{\r}This is taking too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.46,0:51:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你对他太仁慈 现在起不许休息了\N{\r}you've been to easy on him. No more rest periods.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.71,0:52:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我相信 我们会找到跟你受过类似伤\N{\r}I am certain, we can find other service men with wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.28,0:52:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但却把执行此任务\N{\r}similar to yours who'll
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.67,0:52:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}视为无上荣耀的士兵\N{\r}consider being a part of this program an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.96,0:52:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不不 等等 什么\N{\r}No, no, no, no, no. Wait, wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.82,0:52:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}送他回去 驱动通电\N{\r}Send him back. Charge the drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.85,0:52:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}And Captain Stevens,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.71,0:52:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我得提醒你 这可不只是为了你自己\N{\r}I'd like you to remember that it's not only about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.65,0:52:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}更是为了外面两千万美国人\N{\r}but it's also about 2 million real world Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.53,0:52:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你可能不珍惜你的命\N{\r}Now you may not value your own life,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但我请你珍惜他们的生命\N{\r}I do however ask that you value theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.70,0:52:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}建议\N{\r}Advice....
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.57,0:52:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}老头\N{\r}Hey Grandpa.....
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.48,0:52:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}冷静下来 你回来了\N{\r}Calm yourself, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.26,0:52:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}找到设弹人了吗\N{\r}Did you find the bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.59,0:52:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}车上有几百个人\N{\r}There... are hundreds of people on that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.37,0:52:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那就一个一个地去检查\N{\r}Well, then check them out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.39,0:52:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你怎样对他们都无所谓 反正他们都死了\N{\r}Doesn't matter what you do to them, they're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有必要的话 就拿枪杀了他们\N{\r}Get to that gun and shoot them all if you have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.42,0:53:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是一定要搞到有用的情报\N{\r}but get us some usable intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 等等\N{\r}No! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.88,0:53:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在找到设弹人之前 你必须反复穿越\N{\r}We have to keep doing this, until you find the bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.48,0:53:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}摆脱 我一直在努力\N{\r}Please, I am trying, I am trying
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谁是投弹手\N{\r}Who is the bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.65,0:53:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我在努力\N{\r}I am trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.81,0:53:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}抱歉 上尉 我知道你很累\N{\r}I am sorry, Captain. I know you are exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们也都很沮丧 但我们输不起\N{\r}and we are all frustrated, but we can not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.56,0:53:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你做得到的\N{\r}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.81,0:53:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我做不到 - 你可以\N{\r}- I can't, I can't. - Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.16,0:53:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你天生就是英雄 即使你父亲也这样想\N{\r}You are a born hero, son. Even your father thinks so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.06,0:53:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你最擅长的就是救人于危难之中\N{\r}Saving people is what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.56,0:53:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们之前有些矛盾 我不想和他修复关系\N{\r}It was about a stir, too. I didn't wanna regroup back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.21,0:53:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我只是开始觉得\N{\r}I just..... started feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.68,0:53:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他再也不想回家了\N{\r}like he didn't wanna come home anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.36,0:53:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 爸 是你吗 - 他还是没能回来\N{\r}- Dad? - Somehow, he couldn't come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.48,0:54:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也不愿意跟我沟通 或是听我说话\N{\r}and he wouldn't talk to me.... wouldn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.33,0:54:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他只说...他不能就这样\N{\r}Hardly said he just.... couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.48,0:54:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}离开他的部队 所以一直在服役\N{\r}leave his unit out there without him and that was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.09,0:54:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那些战友 才是他的家人\N{\r}Those guys.... were his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.31,0:54:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我说了两件我不该说的事 也许吧\N{\r}I said two things I shouldn't have. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.71,0:54:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我从未真正了解过他\N{\r}I never fully understood him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.25,0:54:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也不敢相信他就这样死了\N{\r}And I can't believe he is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.83,0:54:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}送我回去\N{\r}Send me back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.72,0:55:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}拜托别再把我炸飞了\N{\r}Please don't blow me up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.60,0:55:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}拨号 065- 012- 6758
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道是你\N{\r}Hello? I know, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.33,0:55:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会找到你的 给我回头\N{\r}I am gonna find you. Turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.73,0:55:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你好啊 - 我吗\N{\r}- Hey there. - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.51,0:55:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你惊讶个什么\N{\r}Why you look so surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.71,0:55:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}坐着别动\N{\r}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.53,0:56:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}坐边上点 快 把包放那儿\N{\r}Move. Move. Move. The bag over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.02,0:56:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}往里点 把包放对面然后往里坐\N{\r}Move over, put the bag over there and move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.53,0:56:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}坐过去 把手机给我\N{\r}Move over. Now hand me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.89,0:56:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这下你玩完了 - 什么\N{\r}- You're done! You're done. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.43,0:56:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你不能再害人了 - 什么 我不明白\N{\r}- You can't kill anybody anymore. - What? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.30,0:56:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你要用手机引爆炸弹 - 什么\N{\r}- You gonna trigger the bomb with your phone. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.93,0:56:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我发誓我不知道你在说什么\N{\r}I swear I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.34,0:56:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}听着 我叫乔治·特洛克山 是个软件工程师\N{\r}Listen, my name is George Troxel, I am software engineer, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.33,0:56:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}刚在跟老婆打电话\N{\r}I was talking to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.79,0:56:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}再打一次 你再拨一次\N{\r}Try it again. Your call, dial it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.47,0:56:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那好 我只要按下重播键\N{\r}Ok, I am gonna press redial.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.41,0:56:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的电话就会响 然后我就一枪解决你\N{\r}Your phone is gonna ring and then I gonna shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.12,0:56:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}该死 很抱歉\N{\r}Shit, I am sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.13,0:56:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的东西掉了\N{\r}Hey! You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.88,0:56:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谢谢\N{\r}Wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.46,0:57:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}车门即将关闭 请全员上车\N{\r}All aboard. Doors are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.11,0:57:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}该死 不 开门\N{\r}Shit, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.75,0:57:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不\N{\r}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.01,0:57:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}紧急出口
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.61,0:57:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你可以的\N{\r}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.00,0:58:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}停车\N{\r}Stop the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.11,0:58:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}伊利诺斯 5CGY847
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.10,0:58:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 德里克·弗罗斯特 - 什么事\N{\r}- Derek Frost - Yes?
