Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.51,1:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 要给你带点什么吗 - 不 不用了\N{\r}- Can I get you something? - No, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.83,1:06:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么问这个 想约我吗\N{\r}Why, you asking me on a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.10,1:06:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不好意思 无意冒犯\N{\r}Sorry, poor taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.28,1:06:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你结婚了吗\N{\r}Are you married?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.81,1:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没有\N{\r}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.64,1:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我离了\N{\r}I am divorced.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.60,1:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你觉得有没有另一个自己\N{\r}You think there is an alternate version of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.52,1:06:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一个做出不同选择的戈德温\N{\r}A Goodwin who made different choices?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.33,1:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}什么意思\N{\r}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.62,1:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}比如说 你没有结婚\N{\r}like uh, you didn't get married or
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.62,1:06:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也没离婚 或者刚和别人结了婚\N{\r}you didn't get divorced, or just married someone else
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.56,1:06:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}选择了人生中不同的岔路\N{\r}a woman who has took a different fork in the road?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.99,1:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 我不觉得 上尉\N{\r}No, I don't, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.08,1:06:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你所经历的只是幻影\N{\r}What you experienced was a shadow,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.99,1:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是一个遇害者脑中的残像\N{\r}it was an afterimage of a victim on a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.86,1:07:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这里才是真实世界\N{\r}This is real life, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}跟挂掉的飞行员通话也叫真实吗\N{\r}The one where you talking to a dead helicopter pilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.06,1:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个程序的初衷不是为了改变过去\N{\r}The program wasn't designed to alter the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.22,1:07:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而是左右未来 这你已经做到了这点\N{\r}it was designed to affect the future. And you have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.65,1:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我搞砸了点事情 上尉\N{\r}I missed something, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.49,1:07:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那列车不该爆炸\N{\r}That train shouldn't have blown up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.24,1:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}肯定还有另一个引爆器\N{\r}There must have been a second detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.89,1:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}备用的 我没发现\N{\r}Something I couldn't see. A fail- safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.46,1:07:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是电脑程序 上尉\N{\r}It's a computer program, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.51,1:07:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}车上的姑娘 还有其他人 都已经死了\N{\r}The girl on the train, all the others, they're lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.16,1:07:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我很抱歉\N{\r}I am sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.60,1:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道的\N{\r}I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.46,1:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}量子物理 寓式积分\N{\r}I know, quantum physics, parable calculus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.11,1:07:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但你错了 戈德温 大错特错\N{\r}You're wrong, Goodwin. You're just plain wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.28,1:07:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 克莉丝汀娜已经死了\N{\r}Captain, Christina is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.40,1:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她有机会活下去的\N{\r}She doesn't have to be, Ma'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.26,1:07:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我问问拉特里奇\N{\r}I'll ask Rutledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.70,1:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我求求你\N{\r}I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.81,1:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}求你...把我...送...\N{\r}I'm asking you..... Just..... send me.....
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.42,1:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}送我回去 终止我的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.55,1:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只要八分钟而已 戈德温
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.30,1:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉\N{\r}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.17,1:09:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}决定权在你\N{\r}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.11,1:09:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这段源代码结束时我会关闭生命维持系统\N{\r}At the end of this Source Code I'll terminate your life support.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.16,1:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你再也不会回来了\N{\r}There willl be no coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.49,1:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我一定能拯救她 戈德温\N{\r}I am gonna save her, Goodwin!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我一定能拯救她 戈德温
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.96,1:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很荣幸为你效劳 上尉\N{\r}It was an honor, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.42,1:09:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谢谢你的表现\N{\r}And I thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.89,1:09:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}祝你好运\N{\r}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.79,1:09:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我采纳了你的建议\N{\r}I took your advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.51,1:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你要去印度当老师了\N{\r}You're gonna move to India and become a Guru.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.72,1:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当心 女士\N{\r}Careful, ma'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.66,1:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没错 我要在深山里找寻自我\N{\r}Yeah, I am gonna go find myself in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.93,1:10:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}走之前 你也许可以跟我喝杯咖啡\N{\r}Well maybe you have a cup of coffee with me before you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.59,1:10:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好啊 我很想做那个前青春期测试\N{\r}Yeah, I like to do that pre- teen test.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.06,1:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好的\N{\r}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.16,1:10:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}要不今天做吧\N{\r}Let's do it today.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.83,1:10:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}把班翘掉 布莱恩可以找别的助手\N{\r}Let's just skip work. Bryan can find someone else to assist him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.23,1:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你知道吗 - 知道什么\N{\r}- You know what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.92,1:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我感觉很棒\N{\r}I feel really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.65,1:10:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么\N{\r}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.85,1:10:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为就你这一杯咖啡\N{\r}Cause I have been waiting for weeks
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.20,1:10:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我都等好几个星期了\N{\r}for you to ask me for a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.07,1:10:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}您的票\N{\r}Ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.25,1:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好的\N{\r}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.35,1:10:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}等我几分钟好吗 我马上回来\N{\r}Just give me a couple of minutes ok? And I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.28,1:10:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我得去...拯救世界\N{\r}Gotta go... save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.54,1:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我就知道他是个闷骚子\N{\r}I knew he was a keeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.58,1:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天气真不错\N{\r}Beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.08,1:11:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 您的票 - 不好意思 对不起\N{\r}- Ticket. - Oh, I am sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.67,1:11:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你相信国防部吗\N{\r}You trust the DOD?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.03,1:11:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们掌管财政大权\N{\r}They got the finances.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.18,1:11:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊 没错 如果我们拿到资金\N{\r}Yeah, well sure. Look, if we get the funding.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.68,1:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我向你保证 我们在年底前\N{\r}I guarantee you... we can have at least....
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}至少会有八个源代码计划在正常运转\N{\r}8 Source Code projects up and running by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.00,1:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 真会有那么多吗 - 说不定会更多\N{\r}- Really that many? - Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.63,1:12:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你真是大英雄 拉特里奇博士 - 谢谢\N{\r}- You're real hero, Dr. Rutledge. - Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.87,1:12:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们今天确实救了不少人\N{\r}We did save lives today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊 项目大获全胜\N{\r}Yes, a true victory for the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.73,1:12:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 是我们共同的胜利 - 以后再聊\N{\r}- A great victory for us all. - We'll talk soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.42,1:12:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}激动人心的时刻到了\N{\r}So...... exciting times.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.99,1:12:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}启动SC- 1记忆移除程序\N{\r}Let's initialize the memory wipe on SC- 1
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.39,1:12:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}开始处理数据\N{\r}and start crunching the data.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.17,1:12:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}先生\N{\r}...Sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.80,1:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们不是跟斯蒂文斯上尉说好了\N{\r}We, we.... we told Captain Stevens,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.82,1:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让他安息的吗\N{\r}that we were gonna let him die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.42,1:12:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让他死 他刚刚救下了无数条生命\N{\r}Let him die? He just saved millions of lives today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.63,1:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有了他 以后能避免多少灾难\N{\r}How many other disasters might he avert down the line?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.92,1:12:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而且据我们所知 他可能\N{\r}For all we know, he may be
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.17,1:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是能让这套系统运行的唯一人选\N{\r}the only candidate with which the system works.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.20,1:12:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以 清除他的记忆 初始化源代码\N{\r}So, let's clear his memory and reinitialize Source Code.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.63,1:12:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好吗\N{\r}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.11,1:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}遵命\N{\r}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.51,1:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不好意思 我...\N{\r}Sorry, I just....
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.71,1:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}德里克 你不在这站下呀\N{\r}Hey Derek, this isn't your stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.32,1:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}先生 你把这个掉了\N{\r}Hey Mr. You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.90,1:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}过来 到后面来\N{\r}Come on, back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.01,1:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}德里克\N{\r}Derek.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.02,1:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}都结束了\N{\r}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.09,1:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}明白吗\N{\r}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.74,1:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我叫德里克·弗罗斯特\N{\r}Hey, my name is Derek Frost.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.22,1:14:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我在一辆白色货车中安置了一个核装置\N{\r}I planted a nuclear device in a white van,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.77,1:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}车停在格伦布鲁克站的CCR停车场\N{\r}parked in a Glenbrook Station CCR parking lot
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.91,1:14:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在我被铐在944 CCR列车的扶手上\N{\r}right now I am handcuffed to a pole
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.01,1:14:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}列车正驶往芝加哥联合站\N{\r}on the 944 CCR train, headed to Chicago Union Station.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是个变态的可怜虫\N{\r}I am a sick and pathetic human being.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.14,1:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我渴望一段漫长的监狱之旅\N{\r}And I need to be locked away for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.11,1:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好了\N{\r}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.00,1:14:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}德里克 今天你是夷不平这个世界了\N{\r}Derek, there's no more burying the world in rubble today.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.62,1:14:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不介意我借用一下吧\N{\r}You mind if I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.88,1:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上尉 我们哥几个要去庆祝一下\N{\r}Captain, some of the guys and I are gonna go celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.81,1:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们让我启动记忆清除程序 上尉\N{\r}And.... they want me to initiate the memory wipe, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.31,1:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你好 上尉\N{\r}Hello, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.91,1:15:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你好 - 是唐纳德·斯蒂文斯吗\N{\r}- Hello? - Donald Stevens?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.16,1:15:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是我\N{\r}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.67,1:15:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我叫肖恩·斯蒂文斯 - 你是谁\N{\r}- My name is Shawn Fentress. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.22,1:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我和您儿子考尔特一起服役\N{\r}I served with your son, Colter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.85,1:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天呐\N{\r}Oh boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.89,1:16:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很抱歉这么久才打电话给你\N{\r}It's a..... I am sorry it has taken me so long to.... call you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.80,1:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有时候自己需要一些时间 \N{\r}Sometimes it just takes a while
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.48,1:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}才能找到最想说的话\N{\r}to figure out what you wanna say, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.36,1:16:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别太勉强自己\N{\r}Ah, don't be too hard on yourself...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.96,1:16:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}打这个电话并不容易\N{\r}It's not an easy call to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.24,1:16:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}先生 您过得还好吗\N{\r}How are you doing, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.40,1:16:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}运回来的只有些骨灰\N{\r}All that came back was some ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.18,1:16:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很难相信那就是他\N{\r}It's hard to believe that it was him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.66,1:16:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你有多了解他\N{\r}How well did you know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.15,1:16:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他牺牲的时候我在场 他说...\N{\r}I was there when he died, Sir. He said...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.92,1:16:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你们的最后一次谈话 言辞很激烈...\N{\r}that the last time that you guys talked, ehm... was tough ....and
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.18,1:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他想说声对不起\N{\r}he wanted to say that he was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.02,1:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我只想让他平安回来\N{\r}I just wanted him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.27,1:17:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我很爱他\N{\r}I loved him so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.60,1:17:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 真希望能亲口告诉他 - 他知道的\N{\r}- I wish I could have told him that. - He knows it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.55,1:17:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}保重 斯蒂文斯先生\N{\r}Take care, Mr. Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.76,1:18:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\r}- You ok? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.49,1:18:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 拯救世界了 - 差不多吧\N{\r}- Saved the world? - Sorta.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.64,1:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}刚说到哪儿了\N{\r}So, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.98,1:18:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}去喝咖啡\N{\r}Getting some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.89,1:18:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是拉特里奇博士\N{\r}Dr. Rutledge?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.84,1:18:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}什么\N{\r}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.75,1:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}该死\N{\r}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.74,1:19:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这有什么难的 我是经商的好吗\N{\r}What is too hard about it? I run a business, ok?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.44,1:19:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}要么按时完成工作 要么卷铺盖滚蛋\N{\r}Everything moves on time or people get fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.16,1:19:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现实世界就是这么残酷\N{\r}That's how it works in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.04,1:19:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 十分钟 - 老兄\N{\r}- 10 Minutes. - Hey buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.47,1:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别为些琐事汗流浃背 小心汗水逆流成河\N{\r}Don't sweat the small stuff, you'll drown.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.35,1:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}多谢大师指点迷津\N{\r}Oh thank you for the moment of Zen,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.30,1:19:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但我又没跟你说话\N{\r}but nobody was talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.40,1:19:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你算什么 大喇叭广播吗\N{\r}What do you sound, self help cds today?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.48,1:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}管好自己的事得了\N{\r}Why don't you just mind your own business?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.31,1:19:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}保安 带一队人马过来 速度\N{\r}Security? Get me a detachment of MPs here. This instant!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.96,1:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么你老爱挖苦人呢 马克思\N{\r}Why are you always so bitter, Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.49,1:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}朋友 这世界就是如此残酷\N{\r}It's a bitter world we living my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.90,1:19:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你想让我怎么办\N{\r}What you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.03,1:19:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没必要这样的\N{\r}It doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.07,1:19:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我赌一百块\N{\r}I will bet you 100 dollars,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.10,1:19:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}赌你不能把车里所有人逗笑\N{\r}that you can't make all the people on this train laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.60,1:19:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好了\N{\r}Oh right...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.62,1:19:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这总共有...126块\N{\r}Actually, 126 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.88,1:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你就这么玩儿我吗\N{\r}Is that your way of making fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.96,1:19:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 为了让今天多点欢乐\N{\r}No, it is to have a better day...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.35,1:19:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 我接受 手到擒来\N{\r}No, no. It's good. Easiest money ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.03,1:20:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}打扰一下 朋友们 我的一个乘客朋友\N{\r}Hey, I... excuse me, people. One of our fellow passengers
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.89,1:20:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}给了我点钱\N{\r}has decided to offer me some money....
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.56,1:20:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你今天怎么了\N{\r}What has just gotten into you today?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.02,1:20:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}像是变了个人\N{\r}You're like a different person.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.80,1:20:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这是全新的我 - 我喜欢\N{\r}- It's the new me. - I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.88,1:20:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}女人们总把我的姓搞错\N{\r}Women always mess up my last name.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.57,1:20:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有天晚上我跟一姑娘在一起\N{\r}I was with a girl the other night and
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.65,1:20:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她总是叫我"滚开"\N{\r}she kept calling me "Getoff".
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.65,1:20:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}译注: 滚开在英语中与此人姓氏谐音
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.31,1:20:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她说 滚开 滚开 我说 不 我叫丹诺夫\N{\r}She goes "Get off, get off" "I am "No, Denoff,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.47,1:20:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她说 不是 你又胖又重 快滚开\N{\r}Denoff", she: "No, you are fat and you are heavy, get off!"
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.27,1:20:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好了吗 还要二十秒\N{\r}Good? 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.38,1:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}给你十秒\N{\r}Make it 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.12,1:20:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温\N{\r}Goodwin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.77,1:20:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}看看这一切\N{\r}Look at all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.31,1:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}什么\N{\r}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.26,1:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所有这些生命\N{\r}All this life.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.43,1:21:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温 快把安全门打开\N{\r}Goodwin, open the SC door!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.20,1:21:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么你总不停看表\N{\r}Why you keep looking at your watch?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.85,1:21:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}克莉丝汀娜 如果你只有一分钟不到的生命\N{\r}Christina, what would you do....
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.07,1:21:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你会怎么做\N{\r}if you knew you had less than a minute to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.12,1:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会让每秒都过得有意义\N{\r}I'd make those seconds count.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.01,1:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我会再吻你一次 - 你吻过吗\N{\r}- I'd kiss you again. - Again?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.75,1:21:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温 把这该死的门打开\N{\r}Goodwin, open this god damn door!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.58,1:21:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他已经付出够多了 博士\N{\r}He has done enough, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.04,1:23:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一切都会好起来的\N{\r}Everything is gonna be ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.28,1:23:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}今天是周一 芝加哥的天气很好\N{\r}It is a beautiful Monday in Chicago today.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.13,1:23:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}最低温度可能会达到60华氏度\N{\r}Temperature is expected to reach the lower 60.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.44,1:23:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}目前湖上温度为55华氏度\N{\r}Right now 55 at the Lake....
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.91,1:23:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 他赌赢了 - 是啊\N{\r}- What, he earned that money. - Yea, he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.62,1:23:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他很搞笑的\N{\r}He is funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.52,1:23:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}搞的我现在没钱了\N{\r}Speaking of which... I have no cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.05,1:23:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}过来 我想让你看点东西\N{\r}Come here, I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.10,1:23:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天气真好啊\N{\r}It's such a beautiful day, isn't it
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.60,1:23:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没错 棒极了\N{\r}Yeah, it is a really perfect day.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.72,1:24:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你相信命运吗 - 不太信\N{\r}- Do you believe in fate? - Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.52,1:24:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只能撞些狗屎运 过来\N{\r}I'm more of a dumb luck kind of gal. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.78,1:24:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你今天想干什么\N{\r}So, what do you wanna do today?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们应该在这多待一会儿\N{\r}I think we should stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.04,1:24:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们命中注定要来这个地方 不是吗\N{\r}This feels like exactly where we're supposed to be, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.37,1:24:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 早上好 杰夫 - 早上好 上尉\N{\r}- Good Morning, Jeff. - Good Morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.79,1:24:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}莉莉醒来时穿着晚礼服 披着夜礼服斗蓬\N{\r}Lilly awoke in an evening dress and an opera cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.36,1:25:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她手中拿着五张牌\N{\r}In her hand were 5 playing cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.73,1:25:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}今天某个时候\N{\r}At some point today,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.89,1:25:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你会得知在芝加哥附近的列车上\N{\r}you re gonna hear about
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.90,1:25:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有一个作案未遂的恐怖袭击犯\N{\r}a failed terrorist attack on a commuter train near Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.43,1:25:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是我们阻止了炸弹爆炸\N{\r}You and I kept that bomb from going off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.70,1:25:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有人想在芝加哥城外的CCR列车上引发爆炸\N{\r}An attempted bombing on a CCR train outside Chicago
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.16,1:25:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}危险已被解除 在列车上发现了嫌疑犯\N{\r}but it was foiled. And the suspect was found on board....
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.09,1:25:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}名叫德里克·弗罗斯特\N{\r}Named Derek Frost.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.27,1:25:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温 有什么事吗\N{\r}Goodwin, anything I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.20,1:25:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没什么 我一会儿再来\N{\r}No, that's fine, I'll come back later.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.48,1:25:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}瞪大你的眼睛\N{\r}Well, keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.49,1:25:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这几天 总会有危机浮出水面\N{\r}One of these days, the right crisis is going to rear its head
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.72,1:25:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那时候就该源代码大展身手了\N{\r}and Source Code is going to have its moment in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.75,1:26:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}遵命 长官\N{\r}Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.97,1:26:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你现在正在读这封邮件\N{\r}If you re reading this email,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.37,1:26:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那说明源代码比你和拉特里奇博士\N{\r}then Source Code works even better than
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.23,1:26:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}想的要强大\N{\r}you and Dr. Rutledge imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.87,1:26:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你们以为自己在重现过去的8分钟\N{\r}You thought you were creating 8 minutes of a past event,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.79,1:26:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但事实并非如此\N{\r}but you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.25,1:26:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你们创造了一个新世界\N{\r}You've created a whole new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.31,1:26:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}戈德温 如果我没弄错的话\N{\r}Goodwin, if I am right...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.53,1:26:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在源代码设备的某处\N{\r}Somewhere at the Source Code facility,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.48,1:26:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有一名在等待执行任务的考尔特·斯蒂文斯上尉\N{\r}you have a Captain Colter Stevens, waiting to send on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.45,1:26:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}请一定答应我 你会向他伸出援手\N{\r}Promise me you'll help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.28,1:26:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那时 也请帮我一个忙\N{\r}And when you do, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.24,1:26:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}记得告诉他 一切都会好起来的\N{\r}Tell him, everything is gonna be ok.
